    H -->|Valid| I[Output PII Detection]
    I --> J[Groundedness Validation]
    J -->|Unsupported| S
    J -->|Supported| K[Validated Response]
    I -->|PII Found| L[Redact PII]
    L --> J
    B -.-> T[Test Suite and Metrics]
    H -.-> T
    J -.-> T
    I -.-> T
